        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This place only has 3 machines in operation and there is always 1 out of order or not working. Line ups are frequent and long. Better off using the drop off service where you get paid after 1-2 days when the staff processes it. Everytime we go there is nobody working the front counter. Poorly staffed and obviously more locations are needed like in Vaudreuil-Dorion.",
